        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_00da735dcad340f2883bd05fa47688dd",
      "statement": "The agent Vault reader's only live caller is the gateway's RFC 8693 token re-exchange, which resolves AGENT_GATEWAY_CLIENT_SECRET through resolve_secret and raises a TokenExchangeError when neither Vault nor the environment supplies it — the credential is fail-closed, not defaulted.",
